DSH Academic Web Proxy

This is an independent implementation. It is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Zotero, DeepSeek, institutions, or the academic publishers in its hostname list.

Zotero Connector's public documentation and source informed the URL template
behavior (%u, %h and %p) and redirect-loop prevention. No Zotero source code,
icons, or screenshots are included in this package. Zotero Connector itself
is licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later:
https://github.com/zotero/zotero-connectors

The 47 default hostnames are factual configuration entries for public academic
websites. They are listed in src/default-hostnames.js. Institutional proxy
templates are not included as defaults; both template fields start empty.

The desktop compatibility adapter was independently written for the
dsh-builtin-browser 0.3.1 bridge protocol and DSH Desktop 2.0.17 DOM markers.
No DSH desktop code or browser binaries are bundled. Peer packages retain
their respective licenses. DSH public project:
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
